{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/bcced6250daee23f57aaa0f73cd57fda.webp?t=1754665129\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They killed your dog. <br>You're furious and want revenge.<br>This is fast, violent, and personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/ace07be1a2bb40ace9d770c433478c5a.poster.avif?t=1754665129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/ace07be1a2bb40ace9d770c433478c5a.webm?t=1754665129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/ace07be1a2bb40ace9d770c433478c5a.mp4?t=1754665129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/45898fb738d1ddb45a0af6219a872816.webp?t=1754665129\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid, fast-paced movement on pulsing synth beats turn combat into a violent ballet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stab, smash and shoot your enemies into oblivion.<br>Violence is not just encouraged, it's rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay aggressive. Stay alive. Become unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/a690ec405bf630cf01d35ba4f151207a.poster.avif?t=1754665129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/a690ec405bf630cf01d35ba4f151207a.webm?t=1754665129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/a690ec405bf630cf01d35ba4f151207a.mp4?t=1754665129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/85e3ca0102f594e68e5687da0cc80921.webp?t=1754665129\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own instruments of destruction with a <strong>card-based weapon system</strong> offering <i>nearly unlimited combinations</i>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry 3 weapons per run: <strong>Primary</strong>, <strong>Secondary</strong>, and <strong>Melee</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has <strong>ammo card slots</strong> that define its behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All ammo cards are <strong>interchangeable</strong> across weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize ammo further with <strong>modifiers</strong> that stack and synergize</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix. Match. Break the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/48e6b6a2372b104575e384dee1223ce7.poster.avif?t=1754665129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/48e6b6a2372b104575e384dee1223ce7.webm?t=1754665129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/48e6b6a2372b104575e384dee1223ce7.mp4?t=1754665129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/b92fbee9615645c10619a96eb1e928d6.webp?t=1754665129\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is a smaller version of the full game, but contains enough content to be replayed many times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All card modifiers and events to edit cards planned for the full game are also in the demo. The full game will have more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels (demo has shorter runs)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammunition cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo content might change overtime as the game is still under development.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806250?t=1754665129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806250?t=1754665129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/34efd9168badd6cade6dea16a69836bf06d94797/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754665129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/34efd9168badd6cade6dea16a69836bf06d94797/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754665129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence, Blood, Dead Bodies"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/extras/bcced6250daee23f