ent to be replayed many times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All card modifiers and events to edit cards planned for the full game are also in the demo. The full game will have more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels (demo has shorter runs)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammunition cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo content might change overtime as the game is still under development.</p>","developers":["Brainburn Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3399100","name":"Flashes of Chaos"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806250/ff2cb4de9ca4ace396415f93a8f4cd6c80c579d0/header.jpg?t=1754665129","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257177644,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177644/movie480.mp4?t=1754502444","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177644/movie_max.mp4?t=1754502444"},"name":"Demo Release","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177644/88e02aabadace699e17df07d141b5b537c2d3e81/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754502444","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177644/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754502444","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177644/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754502444"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257172901,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c